{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_st_06-01",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "st_06-01",
  "title": "别说过去的事",
  "storyCode": "6-6",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_06-01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5589defce273ab16c13f6bc182bd38ad23a3c6123acb9d854494c3b6c5808270",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "伊诺，这本书是谈什么的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "啊，我读过了，就给你带来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "我觉得萨沙你会喜欢！这本书是讲理想的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "理想？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "伊诺有什么理想？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "......理想啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "我不知道。我可以有理想吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "当然可以有，为什么会没有！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "啊，糟了，该回家了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "不想走吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "......我不想回家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "可是伊诺你说过，要是不回家，你爸爸就会打你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "明天再见吧？明天还是能再见的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "我知道了。面包和书我就放这里了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "......萨沙，我不想走。好痛。现在回去也会挨打的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "那么明天来了，你如果被打了，就打我吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "啊？......哈哈哈，萨沙，你是不是跟他们打架，把头脑打傻了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "你的身上还有伤，这么多伤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "只要这样，就会有人能知道你很痛。至少有人知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "嗯，我知道你的想法。但我不会的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "如果那几个孩子还在路上欺负你，告诉我！我会把他们全打趴的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "我知道！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "明天见！我还会来唱歌给你听的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我根本不知道他遭遇过什么。\n我只知道他给过我吃的。\n只知道他能读书，我也想读，他就教我。\n只知道其他孩子喜欢欺负他，因为他给我面包，我更有力气些，就打了他们，也被他们打过。\n但我不知道他遭遇的是什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "我很怕。萨沙，我很害怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "我似乎......似乎不属于那个家。我偷听说，我妈妈......我妈妈根本不在家里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "他们看我的眼神，都很可怕，我不想回去了。我不想再回去了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "可是，这里既没有吃的，也没有可以住的地方，这里只是......只是下水道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "我不在意的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "但是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "你也讨厌我吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "什么？......为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "因为我喜欢笑？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "不......不。为什么会这样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "因为我不该笑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "没有这回事！伊诺就应该笑下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "是这样吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "是这样的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "是不是那天他不回去，事情就会改变？\n只因为我觉得我这里太脏了，太冷了，就让他回去？\n如果他没有回去，是不是能改变一切？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "你的伤！你肚子上的伤......发生什么，发生什么了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "萨沙......我一直在笑啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "你看，你和我说可以笑的，我就一直笑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "一直在笑......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "萨沙，还要听我唱歌吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "之后，他依然时常来看我。\n只是他身上的伤疤越来越多......\n越来越多。\n我也知道自己说的话会影响他，也减少了张口的次数。\n这会让事情变好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "你的背！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "你的背......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "......很痛？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "不能再这样下去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "究竟是谁做了这些事！为什么要这么虐待你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "不管是什么......这种人都该被毁掉！无论是什么东西，都该被毁掉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "伊诺，带我去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "......我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "我会做到的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我不知道自己说了什么。\n也不知道自己是不是什么都不能再说了。\n我做了什么？我究竟做了什么？\n我也读了许多书了，但没有书告诉过我。\n什么都没告诉我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "看啊，看啊萨沙......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "你和我说过，希望把伤害我的东西全都毁掉吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "快过来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "你的伤......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "不要紧。不要紧的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "你看，只要轻轻一吹......就都好了。全都会好呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "快过来，我给你包扎！布，剩下的布在哪......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "那个男人切了我的脚......只要一吹，就好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "有个老头划了我的背，抚摸一下，也就好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "这都是因为那个胖女人往我嗓子里塞的那块源石！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "别说了，伊诺，别说了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "我没办法再唱歌了，但你看，你看，都亏了这块源石！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "我现在什么都能做到！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "伊诺！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "......你很不开心。为什么？我明明按你说的去做了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "为什么你不开心？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "明明他们都开心的。只要按他们说的去做，他们就都会开心的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "......因为你的所有家人都是混蛋。全部都是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "是啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "所以孩子们把他们杀了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "......什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "那些感染的孩子们，还没被赶到城外的孩子们......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "你把他们怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "他们也打过我啊。他们还弄伤过你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "现在，他们简直就像是棋盘上的棋子一样。棋子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "只要我给他们治过身上的伤，让他们怎么做，他们就会怎么做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "我把那群又丑又恶心的人，全都......全部都！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "萨沙，你看，我做的怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "一把火全部烧掉了！全部！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "萨沙，你怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "别再做这种事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "可你不是说......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "我没想到会变成这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "伊诺，做你真正想做的吧。不是这种事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "我会帮你的。别再这样了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "可我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "别再这样了！做你真正想做的事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "不是被逼着做什么，不是流血流泪，也不是什么复仇！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "你根本不喜欢这种事......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "......萨沙......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "我想......唱歌......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "呜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我什么也做不到。\n我真是没用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "伊诺......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "我不能再唱歌了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "我们一起走吧。我们会活下去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "活下去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "......有什么好的呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "但我们可以一起活下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "你要做什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "这是我从矿场偷来的源石，本来想要卖掉换些吃的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊诺",
      "text": "萨沙！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "唔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "这样，我们就都是感染者了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨沙",
      "text": "让我们一起活下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "那些事情？我不会过问。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你所做的一切都没有理由。你不是为了什么理由才活在大地上的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不，你根本不需要谁去拯救......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "选一个你喜欢的名字吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "这个？好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "梅菲斯特......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "梅菲斯特。从今以后，你就是梅菲斯特。你和以前的你再无瓜葛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我不相信你。我没有权力相信你。能相信你的从来就只有你自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你的所作所为不能一笔勾销，你会永远背负着你做过的一切，哪怕你忘记了，哪怕你不能理解你做了什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你做的一切，你经历的一切，都该成为你的薪柴。它们要逼迫着你，要你内心的火继续燃烧下去......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "直到整片大地都解放，直到你抛弃所有别人给你的东西，直到你终于理解你自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "到那时候，你连这个名字都可以抛弃。是去是留是生是死，你自己选。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "梅菲斯特，我不能改变你的理想。如果你没有，就去找它。我们自己拯救自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我是谁？这不重要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "想知道怎么叫我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......塔露拉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我只是个反抗者，一个普通的人。我谁也不是。只是现在，你可以叫我塔露拉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "而塔露拉没有和我说太多。\n她抱紧了我。在我的背上叩了三下。\n塔露拉相信我。叶莲娜，博卓卡斯替，柳德米拉。他们都相信我。\n我本以为我可以把在那座城市度过的童年抛到脑后。\n只是，事情很快就变了。从那个村庄的事情开始。\n那是一桩惨剧。但为什么这种惨剧会让她变成这样？\n为什么变成这样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "你要我做什么，我就会做什么......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "没关系的。只要你想做，就去做吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我允许了。毕竟你是梅菲斯特。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "可是，你以前说过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "那是几年前的事情了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "随着我们事业的进步，有些事情会自然而然地改变。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "如果不跟上形势，我们就会被淘汰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "所以，我们和我们的感染者同胞，必须争取一个未来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "所有人都可以为了这个理想牺牲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我可以信任你，对吧，领袖？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "对。因为我是塔露拉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我会做到的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "你一定会，我相信你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "没有你，我们做不到。你什么都可以做，也什么都可以做到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "进来吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "你应该全都看见了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你是谁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "当然是塔露拉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "以前的她......不是你这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "塔露拉只是个名字。塔露拉只是塔露拉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "帮助他吧。梅菲斯特需要你的帮助。梅菲斯特需要你去让他有价值。他只信任你我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "塔露拉绝不会这样，你在利用他对你的信任！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我们都没有选择的权力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "你会为他做到的。一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "你想不想看着他死？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "你没意识到吗？在路过那个村子之后，塔露拉就完全变了！她彻底变了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我知道啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "那为什么还这么做？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "除了你和塔露拉姐姐，我谁也不会信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "我也不想选择。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "浮士德，我们去哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "浮士德，告诉我。我们该怎么办？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "......我们活下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅菲斯特",
      "text": "活着难道不痛苦吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "很痛苦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "浮士德",
      "text": "但我们可以一起活下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这本书，是谈论理想的。\n我的理想是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
